\ The first statement about real numbers written in LeanForth (plan MF1;
\ docs/design/MATHLIB_FRONT.md, the measurements' run 14): x + 0 = x + 0 by rfl.
\ Lean: theorem real_refl (x : ℝ) : x + 0 = x + 0 := by rfl
\ Accepted on the Mathlib slice (tests/front/check_mathlib_slice.py), with the
\ axioms Lean reports for it: propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound.
theorem real_refl
  Real explicit: x
  x 0 + x 0 + =
:= by
  by-rfl
end real_refl
